    "detailed_description": "<h1>Add to your wishlist!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.poster.avif?t=1689378603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.webm?t=1689378603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.mp4?t=1689378603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>You may also like</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><strong>To progress through each level, the player must possess specific essential items that are necessary for its completion.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/2233420904a3cc7b9184ffaa3159a758.avif?t=1689378603\" /></span><br><strong>In order to obtain these items, you must meticulously arrange your items and  treasures within your inventory.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/6a2b53e5d2d26189727e33dc6b699cb1.poster.avif?t=1689378603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/6a2b53e5d2d26189727e33dc6b699cb1.webm?t=1689378603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/6a2b53e5d2d26189727e33dc6b699cb1.mp4?t=1689378603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>After that you'll need to engage in the process of selling your treasures to the merchant.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/bcf42a031af9e6416bd6972dd29c012e.poster.avif?t=1689378603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/bcf42a031af9e6416bd6972dd29c012e.webm?t=1689378603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/bcf42a031af9e6416bd6972dd29c012e.mp4?t=1689378603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Now, armed with a substantial amount of pesetas, you possess the means to procure the items you require!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/62be3979c66a2d66887247c0b02aebd6.poster.avif?t=1689378603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/62be3979c66a2d66887247c0b02aebd6.webm?t=1689378603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/62be3979c66a2d66887247c0b02aebd6.mp4?t=1689378603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>To successfully complete the level, all that remains is to place the purchased items back into your inventory.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/b53d744688c9846444e6faf9ba978e45.poster.avif?t=1689378603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/b53d744688c9846444e6faf9ba978e45.webm?t=1689378603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/b53d744688c9846444e6faf9ba978e45.mp4?t=1689378603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong><strong>Use your organizing skills to make all your items fit. </strong></strong><br></li><li><strong>Use your logical thinking to balance your finances and be able to buy the items needed.</strong><br></li><li><strong>Understand the format of several items to find the best fitting.</strong><br></li><li><strong>40 unique handmade levels.</strong><br></li><li><strong>Relaxing music and sound effects made for the game!    </strong></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><strong>To progress through each level, the player must possess specific essential items that are necessary for its completion.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/2233420904a3cc7b9184ffaa3159a758.avif?t=1689378603\" /></span><br><strong>In order to obtain these items, you must meticulously arrange your items and  treasures within your inventory.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/6a2b53e5d2d26189727e33dc6b699cb1.poster.avif?t=1689378603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/6a2b53e5d2d26189727e33dc6b699cb1.webm?t=1689378603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/6a2b53e5d2d26189727e33dc6b699cb1.mp4?t=1689378603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>After that you'll need to engage in the process of selling your treasures to the merchant.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/bcf42a031af9e6416bd6972dd29c012e.poster.avif?t=1689378603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/bcf42a031af9e6416bd6972dd29c012e.webm?t=1689378603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/bcf42a031af9e6416bd6972dd29c012e.mp4?t=1689378603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Now, armed with a substantial amount of pesetas, you possess the means to procure the items you require!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/62be3979c66a2d66887247c0b02aebd6.poster.avif?t=1689378603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/62be3979c66a2d66887247c0b02aebd6.webm?t=1689378603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/62be3979c66a2d66887247c0b02aebd6.mp4?t=1689378603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>To successfully complete the level, all that remains is to place the purchased items back into your inventory.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/b53d744688c9846444e6faf9ba978e45.poster.avif?t=1689378603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/b53d744688c9846444e6faf9ba978e45.webm?t=1689378603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326020/extras/b53d744688c9846444e6faf9ba978e45.mp4?t=1689378603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong><strong>Use your organizing skills to make all your items fit. </strong></strong><br></li><li><strong>Use your logical thinking to balance your finances and be able to buy the items needed.</strong><br></li><li><strong>Understand the format of several items to find the best fitting.</strong><br></li><li><strong>40 unique handmade levels.</strong><br></li><li><strong>Relaxing music and sound effects made for the game!    </strong></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Immerse yourself in the Save Room, a place of safety and respite. Master inventory management while interacting with the enigmatic merchant. Buy, sell, and acquire crucial items to conquer every challenge. Not only will you need cash, but you'll need GUTS to finish this game!",
